# Level 1: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control" - Bot1's Ornithopter gets one on turns 1 and 3 (the opponent's Elvish Mystic is refused as a target on turn 3) and none on the
# opponent's turns. Level 2 (paid on turn 1): "Permanents you control with counters on them have ward {1}". Turn 2: Bot2's Lightning Bolt at the Ornithopter (a counter on it) triggers its one ward (one Talent gives one) and is countered unless Bot2 pays {1}, which it
# cannot, so the Ornithopter lives; turn 4: its Bolt at the Haywire Mite, which has no counter and no ward, resolves and kills it (Bot1 gains 2).

